  "summary": "Bring vibrant flavors to your dinner table in under twenty minutes with this swift <b>Indian curry noodle bowl</b> designed specifically for busy weeknights. Delicate <b>rice vermicelli noodles</b> cook rapidly in hot water before getting tossed into a rich, fragrant sauce scented with warm spices. Whole <b>mustard seeds</b> tempered in hot vegetable oil release a nutty aroma, joining ginger, ground turmeric, and aromatic curry powder. Sweet julienned carrots and tender green peas add bright color and crisp textures, balanced by smooth light coconut milk that binds the dish together effortlessly. This streamlined recipe requires simple pantry staples and minimal preparation, delivering comforting warmth without lengthy simmering times. Sprinkled with chopped fresh cilantro leaves, this vibrant noodle creation proves that weeknight dinners can be both fast and packed with extraordinary regional character. Serve immediately in cozy bowl portions for a complete, nutritious meal.",
